  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Crew creation",
    "section": "19.11",
    "heading": "Creating an expert",
    "lineStart": 1443,
    "lineEnd": 1447
  },
  "section": "19.11",
  "rulesText": "Record the expert's **type** (their specific area of expertise). They might be a *Doctor*, an *Investigator*, an *Occultist*, an *Assassin*, a *Spy*, etc.\n\nAn expert has **quality** equal to your current crew Tier +1. Their scale is always zero (1 person). Your experts increase in quality when your crew moves up in Tier."
}
